      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jaak Yecu da̱ŋ wäl rɛw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu jaakɛ da̱ŋ wäl wi̱cdɛ rɛw cɔl, kä cuɛ kɛ moc lua̱ŋ mi bikɛ kuth tin jiäk tuɔ̱k raar kɛ jɛ, kä bikɛ liaw diaal jakä gɔw kɛnɛ jua̱th diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ciööt jaaknikɛ da̱ŋ wäl wi̱cdɛ rɛw ti̱n, jio̱liɛn ɛ Thay-mɔn min cɔali Pi-tɔr, kɛ däman ni An-dɛ-röw, kɛ Je-mɛth, gat Dhɛ-ba-dii, kɛnɛ däman ni Jɔ̱ɔ̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ Pi-lip kɛnɛ Bar-tho-lo-miw, kɛ Tɔ-mäth kɛnɛ Mɛ̈-thiw, min la thuul tho̱lbo̱kä, kɛ Je-mɛth gat Ɛ̈l-pi-uth, kɛ Thɛ̈-diäth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ Thay-mɔn raan Kɛ-naan, kɛ Ju-däth Ith-kɛ̈-ri-ɔt, ram ëë ci jɛ kɔak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jäkni Yecu kɛ jaak da̱ŋ wäl rɛw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jaak da̱ŋ wäl wi̱cdɛ rɛw ti̱ti̱ jäkä raar, kä lueekɛ kɛ i̱, “/Cuarɛ wä rɛy juri, kä /cuarɛ wä rɛy ciëëŋni ji̱ Tha-mɛ-ria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä wiaa kä det tin ci bath thok duëël I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gua̱a̱thɔ wiaa thi̱nɔ latdɛ ruac Kuɔth, kä wiaa i̱, ‘Ci ciaaŋ kuäärä nhial thia̱k.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakɛ ji̱ jua̱thni kä gɔw, kä jiacɛ nɛy tin ci li̱w, jakɛ ji̱ dhɔapni kä gɔw, kä tuɔ̱kɛ kuth ti jiäk. Cia jek baaŋ, lɛnɛ jɛ muɔc baaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ yio̱w ti bia rɔm kɛ jiɛpnikun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiɛ gök kɛ kui̱ ja̱lun, kiɛ bieyni rɛw, kiɛ wa̱a̱ri, kiɛ kɛɛt, kɛ ɣöö ji̱ läätdä bakɛ ka̱m min görkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä wec kiɛ ciëŋ ɔ bia wä thi̱n ɔ, go̱r ram mi gɔaa rɛydɛ, kä kua te kɛɛl amäni mi wi̱i̱ jiɛɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi cuɔthɛ dueel, nërɛ naath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi gɔw ji̱kɛ, a malun wä kä kɛ, kä mi /cikɛ gɔw, a malun luny kä yɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi tëë kɛ ram mi /ci yɛ bi nyuɔ̱ɔ̱r agɔaa, kiɛ cɛ ruaacnikun bi liŋ, tɛ̈ŋɛ tur ciöknikun mi jiayɛ dueel kiɛ wec ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛpuc, ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ kɛ cäŋ luɔ̱k in di̱i̱t bi gɔaa ni rɛk Thɔ-dɔm kɛnɛ Go-mo-ra, kä jɛn rɛk ɛmɔ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ben ciɛŋni jiäkni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ɣän ja̱kä yɛ kä raar ce̱tkɛ det ti rɔɔm rɛy jio̱o̱kni nyapëc, kä inɔ, a wuɔ̱thkun te cuŋä ce̱tkɛ thɔ̱ɔ̱l, kä kɔ̱a̱cɛ ce̱tkɛ guɔ̱kni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niɛkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ kɛ, kɛ ɣöö bikɛ yɛ naŋ gua̱a̱th luɔ̱k, kä bikɛ yɛ duäc rɛy gua̱thni palikiɛn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä ba yɛ yɔ̱a̱c nhiam ruëëcni kɛnɛ kua̱r kɛ kui̱dä. Kä bi nɛmɛ a ruac nenä kä kɛ kɛnɛ nhiam ji̱ ɣɔaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi naŋkɛ yɛ, /cuarɛ diɛɛr kɛ mi bia lat kiɛ mi bia lar, kɛ ɣöö mi bia lar ba jɛ ka̱m yɛ kɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ɣöö /ciɛ yɛn kɛn tin bi ruac ɔ, ɛ Yiëë Guurun ɛnɔ ruac rɛydun ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bɛ tekɛ nɛy ti bi dämani gɔany li̱th, kɛnɛ wutni ti ba gaatkiɛn luɔm. Kä bi gaat tekɛ tɛ̈r kɛ diëëthkiɛn, kä bikɛ gua̱ni jakä li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ba yɛ nyir ɛ nɛy diaal kɛ kui̱ cio̱tädä. Kä ba ram mi tee dhieel amäni pek teekädɛ kän. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi muɔckɛ yɛ riɛk rɛy wec kɛl, barɛ rɔ̱ rɛy cieŋ in dɔ̱diɛn, kɛ ɣöö ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, /cia bi wä rɛy ciëëŋni I-thɛ-rɛl diaal, a /ken Gat Ran ben.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ram mi ŋi̱eeckɛ /ci di̱tni jɛn kä ram in ŋi̱i̱c jɛ, kä /ci di̱t ni raan läätdä kä kuäärɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ro̱ŋɛ kɛ ram in ŋi̱eeckɛ ɛn ɣöö derɛ ce̱tkɛ ram in ŋi̱i̱c jɛ, kä raan läätdä ce̱tdɛ kɛ kuäärɛ. Kä mi cɔalkɛ kuäär thuɔk duëël i̱ Beel-dhi-bul,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jɛn ɛ bo̱o̱th yieyni ti jiäk mi lot ni ɣöö bo̱o̱th kuthni guääyni.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bi ba̱l ni jiääk cio̱tdä ji̱ gɔaalɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ram in dee naath dual kɛ jɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä inɔ /cuarɛ dual kɛ naath, kɛ ɣöö thilɛ mi ca kum mi /ca bi nyoth, kiɛ mi ca tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ mi /ca bi ŋa̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi cä la̱t yɛ rɛy muɔ̱th, latdɛ jɛ rɛy buɔyä, kä mi cia liŋ kɛ mua̱th mua̱th, latdɛ jɛ wi̱i̱ duëël. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cuarɛ dual kɛ nɛy tin na̱kɛ ni puɔ̱ny kä /cikɛ tiey dee näk. Kä dualɛ kɛ ram min dee tiey kɛnɛ puɔ̱ny näk guäth maac in thil pek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ca kɛc da̱ŋ rɛw kɔk kɛ tarip? Kä thilɛ kɛl kä kɛ mi dee li̱w a kui̱c Guurun ɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A cäŋɛ ni mi̱em wuɔ̱thnikun diaal ca kɛ kuɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, /cuarɛ dual, di̱t ni kökdun kä kɛc ti nyin ŋuan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lätni ŋa̱thdu naath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ nɛy diaal tin latkɛ ŋa̱thdiɛn nhiam nath, ɣän bäkɛ ŋa̱c bä nhiam Gua̱a̱r in te nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi gaak ɣä nhiam nath, bä jɛ gak bä nhiam Gua̱a̱r in te nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ mal duundɛ ɣöö ɛ ko̱r",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“/Cuarɛ jɛ car i̱ cä ben kɛ ɣöö bä mal nööŋ wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n, ɣän /ka̱n ben kɛ ɣöö nööŋä ni mal, duundɛ ɣöö nööŋä ni mut.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bi Kuoth nɛy tin nyuɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ ja̱a̱ŋkɛ thöp muc",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ram mi nyuur yɛ nyuurɛ ni ɣä, kä ram mi nyuur ɣä, nyuurɛ ni ram ëë jäk ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ram mi nyuur gök kɛ ɣöö ɛ gök, bɛ muc go̱kä jek, kä ram mi nyuur gua̱n cuŋni kɛ ɣöö ɛ gua̱n cuŋni, bɛ muc gua̱n cuŋni jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛpuc ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, ram mi mooc ram mi tɔt kä nɛy ti̱ti̱ kɛ pi̱ ti kɔ̱c kɛ ɣöö ɛ raan kɔaar Yecu, /ci mucdiɛn bi bath.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
